{"availability":"available","full":"angularcafe/ngXpress","name":"ngXpress","description":"Build production-ready Angular apps with ngXpress — a full-stack starter kit powered by Angular 22 +  SSR, Express 5, Prisma 7, Tailwind CSS, spartan/ui and Better Auth for seamless authentication.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":82,"forks":10,"created":"2025-07-08T10:25:00Z","updated":"2026-09-08T08:05:52Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ngxpress.dev","topics":["angular","angular-express-nodejs","angular-fullstack","angular-ssr","angular-starter","angular-starter-kit","angular-starter-template","angular-tailwindcss","angular-zoneless","fullstack-starter","nextjs-for-angular"],"demo":"http://demo.ngxpress.dev/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:22.560Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:22.560Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:22.560Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:06:22.560Z","stars":82,"forks":10}],"technologies":["Angular"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[](./package.json) []( []( []( []( []( []( [](LICENSE)","ngXpress is an Angular full-stack starter: one process, server-side rendering, a real API, and auth that ships. This is a production-oriented Angular 22 + Express 5 boilerplate with out-of-the-box SSR, zoneless execution, Prisma 7 (PostgreSQL by default; any database Prisma supports), Better Auth, spartan/ui (Helm + Brain — the shadcn-style kit for Angular), Tailwind CSS 4, and Signal Forms. Feature-first on both the UI and the API — clone it, rebrand it, ship it.","This is the first tagged baseline of ngXpress on the current stack. If you used the earlier Angular 20 / SQLite / npm template, see Upgrading from the Angular 20 template — treat this as a new start, not a drop-in merge."],"features":["Angular 22 — standalone components, signals, native control flow (@if / @for), zoneless by default","SSR in one process — @angular/ssr + Express 5; no separate frontend/